<title>USA: Armor Holdings files to offer 3.5 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Armor Holdings files to offer 3.5 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSONVILLE, Fla. 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Armor Holdings Inc said Tuesday that it has filed a registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission for the sale of 3.5 million shares of common stock.</p>
<p>The company said proceeds from the offering will be used to reduce debt, provide working capital and potentially to fund acquisitions.</p>
<p>All of the shares will be offered by the company.</p>
<p>Dillon, Read &amp; Co will act as the managing underwriter and Equitable Securities Corp and Stephens Inc will act as co-managers for the offering.</p>
</text>
